Position: CFO/Finacial Manager (IT, SaaS,Startup)
Moreinfo: Chief Financial Officer
Orderry
Dec 2017 - Present ·
Kyiv, Ukraine
Ensuring overall leadership of financial management function underpinned by effective financial controls;
Formulating and updating financial plans in accordance with the company strategy determined by the Board of Owners;
Managing and develop key relationships with banks, payment systems, tax offices and auditors;
Developing KPIs that support the company’s management and development;
Oversee preparation of statutory and monthly management accounts, including cash flow, P&L, Balance and performance forecasts;
Highlighting trends in revenues, margins and costs;
Participation in HR matters, including employee contracts;
Participation in European incorporation and annual compliance;
Maintaining appropriate company policies and rules.

Financial manager
Orderry LLP · Part-time
Apr 2019 - Present 
London, UK

Chief Financial Officer
Smarter Contact · Part-time
Aug 2021 - Dec 2021 · 5 mos
Tampa, Florida, United States

Finance Manager
iPromo · Full-time
Sep 2017 - Dec 2017 · 4 mos
Kyiv, Ukraine 

PJSC UKRMEDPROM
Aug 2015 - Aug 2017 · 2 yrs 1 mo
Ukraine

Oversees all accounting, tax and financial reporting, finance and treasury activities, asset management, human resources and administration functions for the company.
Main responsibilities:
organization of finance department and internal process setting;
setting a targets to the departments; 
participation in the process of financial statements consolidation;
detailed analysis financial and non-financial information (business processes, sales trends, expenses structure, gross margin per products/customers, changes in structure of assets and liabilities, etc.);
preparations of budget and performance tracking;
internal audit and revisions functions;
finance planning;
payroll calculation;
profitability and variability analysis (Profitability and ABC analysis);
cash flow planning (daily, weekly and monthly cash flow forecasting);
preparation of monthly and quarterly analytical reports to management;
work with banks and other credit institutions;
maintain and manage CRM database;
constructing and revising PowerPoint presentations as proposals, presentation material, and pitchbooks.

Economist (finance)
Amstor Trade House Ltd. 
Jan 2011 - May 2015 · 4 yrs 5 mos
Donetsk Region, Ukraine
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 11.0
