candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst (Lawyer/Legal Counsel)
Moreinfo: - Preparation of draft contracts and other legal documents;
- Preparation of legal documents (complaints, pleadings, claims, appeals, applications);
- Pre-trial settlement of commercial disputes;
- Representing company’s interests in courts, public authorities and companies;
- Filing claims, legal assistance in disputes at national courts of different levels and jurisdictions;
- Applications to the European Court of Human Rights;
- Participation in projects and cases of the company in the field of banking law, financial transactions, anti-money laundering, terrorism prevention activities regulation, due diligence, and KYC according to the EU and international law;
- Analysis of European international law and national law of the European Union member states;
- Search for relevant case law and its analysis;
- Assistance in providing advice on the legal regulation of business activities;
- Consulting assistance of shareholders council and CEO;
- Communication with state bodies;
- Resolving of disputes with public authorities;
- Company's assistance during public authorities inspections.
