candidate_text:
Position: Brand Marketing Manager
Moreinfo: 10+ years of international brand marketing and project management experience in the positions of Brand Marketing Manager, Senior Group Head Manager.

Expertise in marketing strategy development, brand positioning, new product launches, 360 marketing campaign implementation, and market analysis.

More about my experience:
- creating and maintaining effective marketing campaigns (360),
- implementing international projects with the involvement tech and marketing teams over the world, 
- best practice and continuous improvement of internal processes
Excellent verbal and written English, ability to work in French.


My last work experience is a Brand Marketing Manager at Vodafone
– Developed and implemented go-to-market, event, and digital strategies resulting in a 30% increase in customer engagement and a 50% increase in brand awareness;
– Delivered global product campaigns for B2B/B2C products in digital, resulting in a 4x increase in quality leads and 160% revenue growth;
– Designed and implemented targeted marketing strategies for digital (SMM, SEO, PPC), email, SMS, and BTL activities, which resulted in a 60% increase in website traffic and an increase in conversion rates;
– Developed corporate identity and design for marketing and sales materials;
– Led new B2B/B2C product launches with cross-functional teams; 
– Improved interaction and lead generation processes for B2B products.

Languages:
English - Fluent;
Russian, Ukrainan - native;
French - Intermediate+

Experience with specialized software:
- Office programs (Word, Excel, Powerpoint, Numbers, Keynote);
- Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Premier;
- Asana, Zoho, Jira, Worksection;
- Google Analytics, AdWords;
- Sites: Wordpress, HTML, HTTP;
- Others: Hrefs, Serpstat, Miralinks, Mailchimp, Ringostat;

Additionally:
- Passed a manual QA tester course, participated in several projects on freelance.
- Passed an SMM course
Looking For: Professional growth as well as new challenges.
