Position: Assistant Project Manager
Moreinfo: Successful performance of 20+ educational projects for over 500+
members of various companies - Boeing, Ubisoft, Xpand etc
Attentive manager with excellent communication skills.Organised and driven with an innate ability to stay on track while dealing with various tasks under pressure.
