candidate_text:
Position: Chief Accountant/Financial Manager
Moreinfo: More than 5 years experience in Finance. 
Experience in Big 4 in Outsourcing Tax&Compliance Department.
A student of ACCA (All F level exams are passed).

Recently worked at IT startup as Chief Accountant. My main responsibilities are:
- to organise financial flows in the group of companies;
- preparation financial statements (stand-alone & consolidated) for group of companies, based in UK and UAE;
- control over month-end/year-end process;
- preparation tax reports (corporate income tax, salary taxes, VAT);
- budgeting;
- building from a scratch accounting process and control over them;
- audit support;
- managing team of accountants (5 people).

My previous experience was as Senior Accountant at outsourcing company. My main responsibilities are:
- accounting for companies from different industries;
- communication with clients;
- financial statements preparation for the companies based in Singapore, Hong Kong, Cyprus, UK.
- audit support;
- managing team of international accountants (3-5 people).
Looking For: I don't want to work with rutine tasks, with primary documents.
Highlights: My main achievement is building accounting process from the scratch for a group of companies. It includes preparation of accounting manuals for accounting department, teaching new employees. In cooperation with legal department building financial flow of the group of companies. Starting process of budgeting in the company. Automatisation of accounting processes.
