Moreinfo:
More than 10+ years of experience in finances on a leading position as a CFO and Manager of FP&A/Accountant departments. Chartered certified professional with combined experience in multinational information/financial technology companies.
 Hold an associate membership of the Institute of Financial Accountants (UK) & Institute of Public Accountants (AU). Highly skilled in financial analysis, financial reporting, management accounting, corporate finance, budgeting and strategic planning. 
Passionate for building strong and effective teams, optimizing business processes, providing financial support and producing strategic recommendations and providing high quality services to a key business stakeholders. Experienced as a Project Manager of SAP implementation (4 years), BAS ERP(1C) implementation with integration to Corp/Bank/CRM systems for UA legal entities. Standardization, automatization and optimization of processes within responsibility ‘own’ and “drive” the process design from start to finish.
Chartered Accountant with an engrained understanding of accounting standards under IFRS, US GAAP and UA GAAP. 

Key Specialties:
• Financial Controlling, Reporting & Analysis;
• Budgeting & Forecasting;
• Management Reporting;
• Auditing & Investigation;
• Financial Software Implementation (SAP, 1C BAS, Tableau & Power BI tools, Zoho CRM system)

AP & AO career spans 12 years of experience in manufacturing, retail and service industries, outsourcing, IT (1> year).
KEY SKILLS AND COMPETENCES:
	- Strong Microsoft Office skills; Xero, SAP, 1C; proficient in Excel (pivot tables); Power BI, Google docs, SharePoint, OneDrive.
	- Excellent analytical, reconciliation and overall troubleshooting skills.
	- Compliance and participation in the development and writing of operating procedures.

RESPONSIBILITIES: 
•	AR – invoices (creation, updating, editing, cooperation with sales team and customers, remittance advices, control of receivables (overdue invoices);
•	AP – posting bills, cooperation with vendors, supplier payment list;
•	FA – register, disposal, run monthly depreciation;
•	Debit/credit card operations, transaction reconciliation (Pleo, PayPal, Merchant Checkout, Cardstream, Barclaycard);
•	Bank statements
•	Monthly reconciliation of balance sheet accounts.
•	Maintaining general ledger and preparing journal entries, posting accruals and monthly expenses;
•	Administration of accounting periods closing (monthly, quarterly, annual PEC)
•	Communication with main accountants from Eastern Europe for elimination of deviations and discrepancies.

I would like to occupy a middle range position in a company that is keen on hiring individuals who are smart, financially aware and tend to personal development and growth. My ideal responcibilities scope : general accountancy + finance analysis

candidate_text:
Position: CFO
Moreinfo: 3+ yers of experience in accounting, 7+ years of experience in finance.
Finance executive with a background in finance management, implementation of managerial accounting for outsourcing and product companies.
For the last years created financial structure of international IT company, Gaming (NDA). I specialize on IFRS, managed finances and cashflow for groups of 6+ entities, in different countries, including UK, EU, HK, UA. 
Have experience in Tax reporting, supported external audit for the group.
Highlights: • Have built the Finance and Accounting Department from scratch, including IE support;
• The working relationships with European banking institutions have been established (compliance issues), the accounting, audit and reporting process;
• Support for Business Development team on financial matters, forecasting, etc.;
• Expenses control and optimization, financial business processes structuring and implementation across the departments.
