candidate_text:
Position: CFO, Finance Director, Deputy Finance Director
Moreinfo: Finance and Reporting:
•	running and coordinating the process of month-end closing and financial reporting process (18 entities);
•	leading the reporting month and year close process for multiple entities (P&L, BS, CF);
•	coordinating communication between different departments and head office;
•	coordinating cost allocation and reconciliation between entities; 
•	providing consistent application of accounting rules within the region and IFRS standards;
•	coordinating timeline and availability of resources to perform regular group audits.
Budgeting and forecasting:
•	running the process of budgeting and forecasting;
•	design and implementing of budget control mechanisms;
•	managing operational data and ensuring data integrity and accuracy for reporting and budgeting process;
•	providing effective financial support and identifying any key risks;
Tax compliance and controls:
•	running internal tax audits for all entities;
•	recommend and implementing efficient tax reports review and preparation processes;
•	working with external consultants in order to find out the best option tax issues;
•	reviewing agreements and commercial deals according to internal approval matrix;
Treasury and accounting:
•	perform all negotiations concerning financing and banking agreements in Ukraine;
•	directing cash management and financial risk management;
•	support the audit process.
Highlights: Ph.D. of Physics and Mathematics
• running the process of budgeting and forecasting from 0;
• design and implementation of budget control mechanisms;
• implementing efficient tax management and control.
