candidate_text:
Position: CFO / Chief Financial Officer / Senior Financial Manager
Moreinfo: Financial executive with 9 years of experience and proven skills in financial processes setup & development. 

Professional expierence:
• Management & improvement of financial accounting policies & processes;
• Setup and development of management accounting & reporting;
• Setup and management of Budgeting and Financial Analysis;
• Management & improvement of cash management processes: Invoicing, Debt collection, Payments planning & execution (wires, EMI);
• Development of accounting software - solutions design and implementation.
• Management of international legal structure;
• Initiating and management of projects aimed to improve financial performance of the company.

Education:
Kyiv National University by Taras Shevchenko, Master’s degree in Economics
CIMA Cert PM Rus Certification
Looking For: I'd like to contribute to a company development not only by maintanence and development of all financial processes, but also by analyzing company performance and looking for a way to improve it.
Highlights: Successfully completed setup & automation of financial processes in a number of companies:
• Financial accounting setup & automation (IFRS/Ukrainian GAAP);
• Financial reporting (PL, CF, BS, management reporting);
• Payment requests and daily treasury processes;
• Budgeting and Financial analysis processes;
• Invoicing & Debt collection;

Carried out a number of strategic projects aimed to improve company financial performance: 
• Gig contracts approach implemented in order to decrease of tax burden;
• International legal structure designed and implemented, financial statement audit passed for 3 years;
• Number of financial models developed (competitors’ model, company & business unit model).
