2022-Present , JSC «Oschadbank», Chief legal adviser
- participation in the preparation of tender documents when purchasing goods, works and services;
- development of tender committee protocols, announcements, notices to bidders, tender documentation (including contracts), reports on completed procurement procedures of JSC "Oschadbank";
- organization of acceptance, storage, disclosure of tender offers according to the Bank's procurement procedures;
- legal analysis of the documents provided by the participants of the procurement procedures in terms of their compliance with the documentation requirements;
- consideration of complaints and preparation of documents in accordance with legislation and internal regulatory documents of the bank.
2021-2022 , JSC «Ukrzaliznytsia», Leading legal adviser
Major Duties:
- providing the initial unit with legal assistance in drafting and/or reviewing contracts;
- legal analysis of the statutory documents of the winners of the procurement procedure on the tender site of the «Prozorro» system;
- participation in the working group to determine the winners of the procurement procedure; - providing legal assistance to employees of production units within the competence;

 - preparation of internal documents of the enterprise (weekly reports, power of attorney, etc).
2016-2021, JSC «Oschadbank», Leading legal adviser
Major Duties:
- providing legal assistance to the initiating unit on the type / method of procurement procedure;
- monitoring the market of suppliers of goods, works and services in order to attract a larger number of participants and monitoring current market prices for the purchase of goods, works and services;
- development of documentation for participation in the tender on the tender sites of the system «Prozorro» on the basis of receiving a memo from the initiating unit in accordance with the Annual Procurement Plan;
- legal analysis of contracts for their compliance with the requirements of current legislation and local regulations of the bank, as well as the main (essential) terms of the contract and other conditions specified in the tender documentation;
- legal analysis of documents provided by the participants of the procurement procedure for their compliance with the requirements of the tender documentation;
- concluding an agreement with the winner of the competitive bidding.
