candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst
Moreinfo: Current position
Business Analyst at the Purchasing Department
Duties:
- As-Is and To-Be process mapping of the workflow in the supply chain; “lean” process improvement; 
- automatization of various processes at the purchasing department; describing business requirements and cooperation with the Development team;
- successful development from scratch and implementation of the new IT-product in 1C Astor – system of preorders. Preorder scheme allows the client to place an order on imported goods while the import process has not started yet; preorders help to give better service to the customers and make 20-30% off the company’s annual turnover in premium-category goods;
- primary testing of the product;
- onboarding and technical support of users (purchase managers, sales managers, logistics managers) after the implementation of the product;
- initiation of new analytical reports in Power BI and describing the requirements for them.


