Purchasing Analyst at Purchasing Department 
Duties:
- demand forecasting;
- effective planning of purchases and warehouse stocks;
- communication with suppliers;
- tracking and reporting key functional metrics (availability of goods, turnover) to reduce expenses and improve customer service;
- calculation of landed cost and selling prices;
- training new employees.
