Position: Accountant / Finance officer/ Finance Controller/ Project accountant
Moreinfo: I am private entrepreneur and External Consultant in Accounting & Finance. Over 9 years of practical experience within accounting & finance, 6th of them in auditing company, 3,5 years of remote accounting and business experience with Danish companies as Danish Accountant from Danish side. I have extensive experience with a numbers of different ERP such as E-economic in Denmark and 1C: Enterprise  in CIS countries.

Business experience: Consulting (as well as wholesale in metal industry and laboratory equipment / trade / services), IT, E-commerce, Mystery shopping.
