Moreinfo: 7 years of experience in international IT companies in finance, 2 as CFO/COO. Can build and optimize financial processes for your company (payroll, invoicing/billing, reporting - you name it), train your staff, implement accounting system (in google sheets or through the software depending on needs and transactions number). Provide management with advising and support not only in finance but all operational management. Have experience in managing operations processes (HR, recruitment, shared resources management including resource management system development and implementation). 
