Moreinfo: More than 5 years experience in Finance. 
Experience in Big 4 in Outsourcing Tax&Compliance Department.
A student of ACCA (All F level exams are passed).

Recently worked at IT startup as Chief Accountant. My main responsibilities are:
- to organise financial flows in the group of companies;
- preparation financial statements (stand-alone & consolidated) for group of companies, based in UK and UAE;
