Position: CFO, Financial director, Head of finance
Moreinfo: 26 years of experience in finance, of which 15+ years in international companies in Ukraine. 

Occupied positions: Finance manager, Head of finance, Finance director. 

Duties:
•	Development and implementation of financial strategy of the entity;
•	Development of accounting & internal control policies, periodical reviews;
•	Corporate accounting (IFRS & US GAAP), statutory and local tax accounting;
•	Budgets development from scratch and the performance control;
•	Monthly analysis and Quarter reviews of the factory financial results;
•	Control of costs saving projects to improve the efficiency:  P + (procurement) & CI (processes);
•	Profitability monthly review to avoid profit leakages, route cause analysis;
•	Cash flow management, all relations with banks, Fx hedging;
•	Shareholders meetings papers flow development, legal support of the activity;
•	Interaction with external and internal auditors, transfer pricing reports;
•	Coordination of tax audits with possible further appeals; 
•	Process in finance and paper flow automation;

Now seeking for an opportunity in corporate finances as Finance Director/Manager or Finance Controller, deputy CFO in a company in Kharkiv.
Dedicated to work, reliable employee with good communications skills. .
Excellent recommendations from employers.

I have diploma as Ukrainian public auditor, IFRS (ACCA), Advance diploma in accounting and business (ACCA).
Looking For: Most preferable industries are:  manufacturing and  IT.
I want to develop myself in a developing company and support the company in achieving the strategic goals.
Highlights: Budgets development from scratch, 
Successful development & implementation of management accounting & internal control procidures;
Very good with accounting (IFRS & US GAAP), Ukrainian statutory and local tax accounting;
