candidate_text:
Position: Chief accountant, Accountant, COO
Moreinfo: Accounting, tax, legal and compliance expertise with more than 9 years of practice. Bookkeeping of International legal entities experience. Deep knowledge and understanding of accounting processes and procedures, IFRS.

- Overseeing various accounting operations and preparing financial statements of International legal entities;
- Organization and controlling of all accounting procedures for the group of companies;
- Planning and controlling the company’s financial flows;
- Payment execution in different international payment systems;
- Communication with international Payment system processing regarding the payments compliance;
- Assistance during the external audit/accounting process executed by international audit & accounting firms;
- Supervision of taxation structure of the group of companies;
- Communications with international partners;
- Agreements proofreading in accordance with financial needs of the company;
- Company financial strategy development and implementation;
- Management of accounting team;
- LLC registration in Ukraine: preparation, submission of documents, Tax regime, bank account opening;
- Setting up accounting from scratch;
- Performing full cycle accounting according to Ukrainian GAAP for several LLCs under the general and simplified tax regime (without VAT);
- Accounting records of export services;
- Preparation of monthly and annual reports to the Tax department;
- Payroll calculation;
- PEs registration/liquidation and bookkeeping;
- Maintenance of documentation flow for each PE;
- Single tax quarterly calculation and submission PEs tax declarations;

I am looking for new challenging opportunities in International accounting in IT sphere on a full time basis. Open for project work or outsourcing.
Highlights: 1. Successful business restructuring in accordance with accounting procedures.
2. Developed and implemented the company's cash flow system in accordance with accounting requirements and international Payment system processing compliance.
3. In accordance with a company's needs made research, proposed an optimal business model and as a result organized operational activities in a specific area of the economy.
4. Departments budgeting structure developed and implemented.
