candidate_text:
Position: Account manager/Junior Project Manager
Moreinfo: I’m a professional with 3+ years of in-house legal practice in IT Product Company. Recently I've decided to take the next step as Account Manager. 

Experience:
Project Manager Assistant in Vayosoft Team
I was responsible for managing Contracts/ RFP/RFI;
Collaborated with procurement (participated in negotiations with suppliers, took part in evaluation of contractors according to company’s procedures);
Organized team meetings, follow-ups, action lists, prepared reports and presentations for upper-management;
I've taken part in creation of new projects from the scratch through MVP to the improvement of a working application

Legal Counsel in Benish Group  
I had relationships with colleagues regarding corporate policy, analysis and minimization of  legal risks within the company and provided recommendations on their application;
Collaborated with internal and external teams (developers, analysts, marketing managers and company's leadership) to oversee activities reducing legal risks;
Communicated with customers, business partners, service providers from a variety of jurisdictions;
Prepared Rules for the provision of services (offers), Privacy Policies, Terms of Use for Applications under GDRR rules; 
Took part in Product development, optimization of business processes of the entire group of companies;
Implemented legal compliance in the various areas of business operations (personal data protection, intellectual property, PR and marketing, sales, payments, consumer rights etc.);
Organizied and maintained contractual activities (legal expertise, drafting of contracts texts in accordance to local legislation and company internal standards and procedures etc.)
Highlights: Based on a wide practical background and understanding of business specific features, I have understanding of the whole cycle of the SDLC and deep knowledge in Data Privacy, Intellectual Property, Commercial and Contract law. I've acquired solid managerial and recruitment experience, developed organizational skills, including attention to detail, multitasking and good knowledge of different managerial methodologies and the ability to adapt them to actual circumstances. I'm able to build relationships within a team and work with international companies/customers.
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 1.0
