Position: BI/SQL/DWH Developer
Moreinfo: Experienced in database and business intelligence solutions development. Strong skills in MS SQL Server, T-SQL, SSRS, SSIS, VBA.
Key responsibilities:
- Development of SSRS reports;
- Configuration and administration of SSRS;
- ETL development using SSIS;
- Development of Looker dashboards;
- Optimization database performance;
- Development of stored procedures, functions, views, triggers, indexes for MS SQL Server, Oracle, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Sybase IQ, Snowflake;
- Development and monitoring of jobs in MS SQL Server;

Also I have basic working experience with next technologies: SSAS, AWS, Airflow, Tableau, Power BI.
