Over 10 years of progressive experience developing and executing HR strategies for middle-sized and large international companies, leading efficient non-delivery teams. 

Proactive HR advisor and business partner to senior management and owners. Highly skilled in communications, mentoring and integrating diverse teams around a common cause. A creative thinker, problem solver and decision maker, who effectively balances the needs of employees with the mission of the company. 

Wide experience in: 
- audit and improvement of HR processes; 
- management of Talent Acquisition and Talent Management cycles; 
- organizational transformation; 
- operations management.

