candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst
Moreinfo: I can be useful in the following areas: software development, business process automation, business process digital transformation, building enterprise process architecture.

Experience.
Tasks:
- elicitation and gathering requirements;
- interviewing stakeholders;
- discovering and modeling business processes "as-is";
- discovering business domain/subdomains, their interactions;
- defining the data flows;
- defining the use cases;
- redesign of the business processes ("to-be" model);
- defining the target system architecture;
- defining the scope business process automation;
- writing the software requirements;
- communicating requirements to the software developers;
- defining the overall associated enterprise process architecture;
- business process analysis;
- implementation of business processes using the BPMS.
Projects:
- Implementation of Document Management System;
- Complex automation of enterprise business processes;
- Implementation of small projects to automate tasks and subprocesses (BPMS);
- Description of enterprise process architecture;
- Business process transformation project.
