Highlights:
During the work as a Business Transformation Manager:
- Increase the company three times for 1 year (from 12 team members to 36);
- Increase the quality of delivery (bag reports from clients decreased by 80%);
- The margin of projects increased by 27%;
- Implement parallels processes as result decrease terms of delivery projects;
- Increased the number of projects which we delivered.

During the work as a Head of PM:
- The developer workload indicator was improved by 20%. As a result, downtime between projects has been reduced to near zero and revenue has increased.
- Increased the company's profit by 40%

During the work as a PM:
- Developed, and implemented a common standard for the team's Time-tracking: improved estimates of developers; the number of projects where developers went beyond their estimates was reduced to almost zero.

Moreinfo:
I could help you: 
- If your project need proper start, build or rebuild in most efficient way; 
- If you need to ensure that technologies will support and drive your business; 
- If you need to solve complex tasks and challenges; 
- If you need to scale and growth your products. 
All these goals could be achieved with proper technical design and step by step plans.
You need to think about goals, targets and milestones - I will help you to transform these into practical plan and requirements. 

Helps to build, transform, optimize Solutions and Applications, Services in proper and efficient way. Clear reasoning about Architecture design to ensure and fulfill with Business and Enterprise requirements. Based on best practices and 10+ years experience at IT Architecture. Requirements identification is essential part of any Architecture design process. 
Architecture design (and refactoring/transforming) for highload, high resilience, scalability requirements at cloud and on-premise/enterprise infrastructure.

Highlights:
