- Implemented HRM System for main processes automatization and employee data keeping (BambooHR).
- Implemented HRM System for Performance Review & OKR automatization (Lattice).
- Launched main policies and HR processes from scratch: Administration, Onboarding & Adaptation, Performance Review 360, eNPS,  Rewards & Recognition, Fun & Edu Events, Internal & External communication, Offboarding.
- Innovated workgame balance:  Internal esports Tournaments for employees engagement and recognition on a regular form.

