Moreinfo: About previous experience
 Prepare and hold a corporate party on the occasion of the company's 15th anniversary
- took part in the development of the holiday concept;
- prepared the text of the invitation and provided information support for activities for the guests;
- was responsible for the speeches of the main managers of the company (texts, images);
 Coverage of the Deloitte Forum "Conductors of Change"
- wrote an article based on the results of the forum;
- prepared theses and messages of the speech of the CEO of the company;
 Preparation and holding of men's and women's corporate events in the company
- worked on the concept of holidays;
- held a men's corporate event (prepared the place, provided information support, collected feedback and wishes)
 Development of company rebranding
- prepared presentations on rebranding of large companies;
- to promote the narrative of the idea of ​​change, developed internal communication "why, how, why" (about the brand and its essence in general);
- conducted surveys and collected colleagues' opinions about the company;
- engaged in the presentation and promotion of the idea of ​​creating a "social corporate responsibility report" in the company's new policy;
 Organization and holding of the New Year's corporate party with the presentation of the new vision of the company's brand
- developed the idea and style of the holiday;
- organized the decoration and monitored the progress of the program;
- engaged in coverage and information support of the holiday;
- participated in the presentation of a new brand idea (informed about the concept, what was relied on and why these changes are necessary)
- collected feedback and wishes after presenting the new concept.

I am interested in communications and PR and I want to learn and develop in this direction
