- writing articles (activities of Kyiv Smart City, urban infrastructure, smart cities, ecology, energy efficiency, IT, transport, etc.);
- writing press releases, announcements, posts for social networks;
- conducting interviews.

Editor
Travel magazine "Around the world. Ukraine", February 2016 – May 2019
- development of the rubricator and the subject of the portal from scratch;
- daily monitoring of news on English-language resources, translation and writing of unique articles;
- cooperation with travel bloggers;
- conducting interviews;
- creation of special projects (for a specific event and by order of the advertiser);
