- social media moderation;
- writing scripts for the YouTube channel, participating in filming.
Highlights: Skill Highlights: writing articles, project coordination, communication strategy, interview, content management in the admin panel, translation.

As a digital communications manager at Amway, I coordinated the migration of the website to the Hybris platform. Despite the extremely tight deadlines, all tasks were completed on time. I was also involved in supporting the launches of new products and promos, and partly in the SEO optimization of the site.

As a content marketer at Artforma, I developed a communication strategy for the beauty brands, created a monthly corporate magazine, and was engaged in influence marketing.

As an editor of the travel magazine, I created unique content, interviewed travel bloggers, launched special projects, and wrote scripts for YouTube videos.

