- Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, ELK;
- Linux troubleshooting and problem-solving;
- Bash scripting
- Python Programming

Highlights:
- Developing a full CI/CD process for a microservices-based project including workflows, tests and environments;
- Organizing the Load/Performance testing process, from requirements gathering and test strategies definition to reporting and preparing recommendations;
- Startup automation testing in QA department (process, culture, environment, continues integration);
- Successful experience in implementation of useful and scalable test-frameworks (Java);

