- Copywriting (texts for case studies, promotional brochures, etc).
- Proofreading, copy-editing;
- Technical writing (tutorials, How Do I instructions);
- Academic writing (some 20 publications in scientific journals of Ukraine and abroad in Ukrainian, Russian, and English);
- Collaboration tools: Jira, Confluence, YouTrack, Redmine;
- Windows, Linux (Ubuntu);
- Google Docs, Office 365;
- Experience with various libraries and frameworks for NLP and text engineering (e.g. NLTK, SpaCy, TreeTagger, GATE, etc).
Open for part-time cooperation (up to 5 hours daily) in the domains of content writing, technical writing, localization.

Languages to work with: EN, RU, UA.

Remote cooperation is also an option.

