candidate_text:
Position: Business Analyst / System Analyst
Moreinfo: Work experience:
• more than 8 years of experience as a Business and System Analyst;
• development and implementation of various banking systems: from document exchange systems to analytical systems with complex calculations;
• work on projects from presale to implementation and adding changes in current systems;
• development of systems with different types of integrations.

My BA duties included the following activities:
• communicating with stakeholders and users to elicit, clarify and prioritize requirements;
• UX/UI prototyping (Figma);
• analysis of API documentation, database tables, mappings;
• description of business requirements for customers (BRD);
• convert requirements into epics, features and stories;
• managing, setting priorities and maintaining product backlog according to Scrum/Kanban methodologies.

I have experience working with:
• backlog, BRD, SRS, ERD, use cases, BPMN diagrams, API documentation;
• UX/UI prototypes (Figma);
• SQL (Oracle, MSSQL), JSON, XML.
Looking For: I like creating systems that make people's work and life easier.
I haven't worked with foreign customers, but I would like to get such experience.
I'm looking for interesting and challenging projects to apply my experience and skills.
Highlights: I developed systems from scratch with many integrations and complex logic.
I developed universal solutions for using in other systems and successfully implemented them.
