3. Automatized and established a process of reimbursement travel expense and employee claims.
4. Organized the team's work, build and optimize processes
5. Assist of annual audit conducted by Danish auditing company. Providing explanations of policy/procedures and responding to auditors requests in a timely and accurate manner;
6. Developed and tested standard accounting procedures, providing corporate frame;
7. Regularly met transaction and reporting deadlines, constantly improved depths of analysis.
8. Interviewed and coached financial professionals.
I am private entrepreneur and External Consultant in Accounting & Finance. Over 9 years of practical experience within accounting & finance, 6th of them in auditing company, 3,5 years of remote accounting and business experience with Danish companies as Danish Accountant from Danish side. I have extensive experience with a numbers of different ERP such as E-economic in Denmark and 1C: Enterprise  in CIS countries.

Business experience: Consulting (as well as wholesale in metal industry and laboratory equipment / trade / services), IT, E-commerce, Mystery shopping.
I'd like to find a challenging job tasks in interesting growing international company. Preferably full-time or part-time remote but also I would consider 2 or 3 of 7 days - in the office.

