Position: Art Director. Branding and Digital products design.
Moreinfo: I am a multidisciplinary designer with a total experience of more than 13 years and an art education.
My main specialization is branding, web and app design.
Using my art skills and vast experience in UI design along with deep technical and marketing understanding, I create superior visuals and functional design for projects of any kind.  
My lifelong passion for art and analytical thinking prompted me to study and master all aspects of graphic design and user experience. I am attracted by spectacular graphics solutions, technologies, and micro-interactions.
