Moreinfo: 25 years of Experience in Information Technology, 19 years in management, and 12 years in top positions in industrial manufacturing and telecom industries;
Managed large, distributed business units with 150+ employees and 30+ locations, including remote teams;
Developed IT strategies aligned with business goals and objectives, and implemented ERP systems and business process automation.;
