Position: AUTOSAR Classic developer/ Automotive Embedded
Moreinfo: Experience in Automotive domain, AUTOSAR Classic subdomain. Have skills in electronics: reading circuits, soldering, working with a multimeter, signal analyzer, oscilloscope. Have a basic knowledge in TCP/IP networks (including Cyclone TCP stack) and in MBSD approach (Matlab/Simulink/Embedded Coder/AUTOSAR Toolbox).

Technical skills:

Compilers:
- Arm GNU Toolchain;
- GNU GCC;
- Green Hills.

MCUs:
- STM32;
- Renesas RH850/ R-Car H3;
- Arduino;
- TI C2000.

