- MS Visual Studio;
- TI Code Composer Studio;
- Renesas CS+;
- STM32CubeIDE/CubeMX;
- VS Code;
- Eclipse IDE;
- HighTec IDE;
- Matlab & Simulink & Embedded Coder & AUTOSAR Toolbox;
- Vector DaVinci Configurator;
- Vector DaVinci Developer;
- Vector CANoe;
- Vector VTT;
- Vector CANdbc++;
- Make;

Debugging & Measurement tools:
- Lauterbach / TRACE32;
- ST-Link;
- Multimeter;
